WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.620
Your first settlements shape
what you can produce and build.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:09.680
Catan Lens helps you compare those
choices before the first roll.

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:12.137
Explore a generated board.

00:00:12.447 --> 00:00:17.027
Catan Lens scores every legal corner, and
the gold ring marks the highest score

00:00:17.047 --> 00:00:17.977
still open.

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:21.738
The card beside the board says
what that corner produces.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.328
Open "Why this corner?"

00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:26.858
for the reasoning in plain
English: how much it yields,

00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:30.458
which resources, and whether
they are rare on this board.

00:00:31.216 --> 00:00:32.826
Curious about another spot?

00:00:33.176 --> 00:00:36.706
Click any corner for a grade,
its share of the best score,

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.066
and why another corner scores higher.

00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:44.523
Keep the best corner instead, and the ring
moves to the second settlement that best

00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:45.813
completes your first.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:50.330
Keep your second settlement to see
resource income and the cards your first

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.240
builds need.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.600
Income is an average; actual rolls vary.

00:00:55.434 --> 00:00:59.404
Practise with sixteen drill levels, or
copy the real board from your table.

00:00:59.694 --> 00:01:03.424
It all runs in your browser,
with no account and no tracking.

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:05.723
Catan Lens.

00:01:06.113 --> 00:01:09.583
Free, open source, and
ready for your next game.
